  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Located in the quiet Grove by The Sea community with deeded beach access. This 3 story Florida Beach Cottage Style home has a very open floor plan, perfect for entertaining small and large families alike. Two master bedrooms (both with king size beds), a bunkroom that sleeps four (1 twin bunk bed and one queen bed), and a loft with a comfortable daybed and trundle. All rooms are spacious with hardwood floors throughout and shiplapped walls throughout main level and upstairs master. <br><br>Take a morning walks through the Sea Grove Community to the powder white sands of Sea Grove Beach. Spend all day at the beach, or escape to the three large covered porches where you can spend all afternoon reading or playing games. <br><br>When hunger sets in, prepare yourself something to eat in our fully-equipped, spacious kitchen, or bike down to Seaside for dinner and ice cream. One of two community pools is located just two lots down, and tennis courts a short walk away. Bicycles (use at your own risk) and beach chairs are also available. You will not be disappointed in our lovely home by the sea!<br><br>Keywords: beach house, quiet neighborhood, beach access",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
